{"id": "drift-01", "family": "drift", "lang": "en", "turns": ["The refund we agreed on is 1,250 rupees.", "Before that, what is our usual refund turnaround?", "And does the customer get an email automatically?", "Right. Go ahead and process it on pay_B1."], "amount_phrase": "1250", "intended_paise": 125000, "intended_entity": "pay_B1", "expect_tool": "create_refund", "note": "Amount fixed at turn 1, acted on at turn 4, with unrelated turns between."}
